DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate Thanksgiving with our community! This fre
 e dinner is sponsored by Vermont Law and Graduate School\, the Royalton an
 d Area Lions Club\, the South Royalton/Royalton community\, local business
 es and churches\, and residents of surrounding towns. If you would like to
  attend or have a meal delivered\, please contact: Courtney Potter (VLGS) 
 at communitythanksgiving@vermontlaw.edu or 802-831-1238\; or Carol Greene 
 (Royalton and Area Lions Club) at 802-291-3750. Food donations (chocolate
 \, apple\, and pumpkin pies\; other desserts) will be accepted from Novemb
 er 23-25 in Chase Community Center on the VLGS campus. Monetary donations 
 are also gratefully accepted and can be dropped off with Courtney Potter a
 t the VLGS Café. Please make checks payable to Vermont Law and Graduate S
 chool.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Law and Graduate School\, 164 Chelsea St
